name: colluding_merchant_refunds
description: "Merchant disputes - cards linked to merchants by chargebacks (via = reason@month) and refunds (via counts the sales that card made there). Look for a merchant that refunds cards it never sold to (sales:0) and whose chargebacks run through the whole year far above its category. A travel merchant whose chargebacks all arrive in one strike month is the innocent version."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: card_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[3]: ts,amount,via
  filter:
    kind: group
    op: OR
    items[2]{kind,field,operator,value}:
      condition,kind,"=","charged_back"
      condition,kind,"=","refunded"
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
